  {
   "text": "That cursed cartridge Epic keeps talking about? It has a real spot on the map.",
   "t0": 0.2,
   "t1": 4.336
  },
  {
   "text": "It's called the Dark Cartridge,",
   "t0": 4.536,
   "t1": 6.003
  },
  {
   "text": "and it's right here, close to the middle of the island.",
   "t0": 6.063,
   "t1": 8.47
  },
  {
   "text": "Epic says it's spreading through the island, corrupting everything it touches.",
   "t0": 8.72,
   "t1": 12.321
  },
  {
   "text": "Would you drop here?",
   "t0": 12.571,
   "t1": 13.49
  },
  {
   "text": "Use code BAD in the Item Shop. It really helps the channel.",
   "t0": 13.64,
   "t1": 16.773
